meta {
  name: 3. Get Balance (A)
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/wallet/balance
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-Telegram-Init-Data: {{initData}}
}

docs {
  balance_stars_equivalent is a display-only estimate (floor division by
  the current star_to_toman_rate) — it's never used to decide whether a
  charge succeeds; every real charge is computed from the priced item's
  own price_stars instead.

  pending_toman is money User A has earned as a provider from chat
  requests that got paid, but hasn't received yet — it only moves into
  balance_toman once the paid-for chat session closes cleanly (not
  built yet, see TECHNICAL_REQUIREMENTS.md section 10 — "pool idle").
  Run Requests > "6. Pay For Request (B)" as User A's provider role and
  check here to see it change.
}
